<title>USA: Sioux City hogs fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderately active. Compared with Thursday, barrows and gilts sold fully steady. Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     48.50-49.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     46.50-48.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     45.00-46.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $1.00/up $1.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs     41.00</p>
<p>		   400-450 lbs     scarce</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs     45.00</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs     50.00</p>
<p>		   550-600 lbs     52.00</p>
<p>		   600-700 lbs     53.00</p>
</text>
